        <rule id="r52-ec-tar-rule-2" name="Hardened Survivor" hidden="false">
          <description>Saul Tarvitz and any unit he has joined improve any Cover Save they receive by 1, to a maximum of 4+. This does not grant a Cover Save. While Tarvitz and his unit are controlling an Objective, they have Fearless.</description>
