        </rule>
        <rule id="r52-ec-luc-rule-2" name="Honour or Death" hidden="false">
          <description>If Lucius is in base contact with one or more enemy Independent Characters, he must direct all of his close-combat attacks against one of those Characters. When attacking an enemy Independent Character in close combat, Lucius may re-roll failed To Hit and To Wound rolls.</description>
        </rule>
